{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/78e4100f5f07d4e3519dfeb442038187.avif?t=1773177740\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a mage apprentice trying to figure out how the world works. Life hasn't been easy for you, since young age you learned the meaning of pain and suffering but what effect will that have on the older you? Revenge? Forgiveness? Once you move to the magic school your life will change and although you're not a big fan of studying, your natural talent and fate will help you reach the top of your college, and after that... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outside world awaits.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/6b0c64b1d6c37956af45d2d99419e5a4.avif?t=1773177740\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you age, and your power grows you will try to learn everything about the world you live in, spells and magic that serve your purposes, what kind of creatures, monsters and gods share the same air as you? What nations favor war over peace and what will that reflect on your own personality? Will you be at war with yourself or will you always be certain of what's the right path for you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you destined to be a savior or a destroyer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/c860dc3ae47359a32b1f5656349991d3.avif?t=1773177740\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel the world you will come across a wide cast of characters, each with their own personalities and abilities that you can explore or ignore. Some may be willing allies, others not so much. Your actions will change how the others see you, will you try to corrupt them? Help them? Will you look for love or you just plan to use whomever you want?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use corruption or love as you please and as some doors close, others get wide open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/2c3a5e1d54666878226cdece99a1c26f.avif?t=1773177740\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has three modes; RPG, Combat and Visual novel. (Visual novel is based exclusively on multiple player choices, no combat, no map travel, no sandbox nor point &amp; click.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Ataegina and its locations. (in the RPG mode you will have a map view on certain locations to visit by &quot;point &amp; click&quot;.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spells in combat to destroy those who oppose you. (in the RPG and in the Combat mode you will face opponents that you fight using your skills and magic in a turn based combat.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interact with several characters... Yes, hot girls included. (In all game modes, characters will have certain stats like &quot;love&quot; that are influenced by your actions, leading to different outcomes.)\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your choices decide what fate has chosen for you. (The game will provide you with multiple choices that lead to different endings.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hours of content, and multiple branching paths there is much fun to have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/0b694355a1259e07e84efc42e42d6c24.avif?t=1773177740\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2929140?t=1773177740","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773177740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773177740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773177740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Ataegina contains a wide variety of adult content. The player can choose to avoid most erotic encounters and how they will roll out. (There will be exceptions such as dreams, memories, visions, illusions etc...)\r\n\r\nThe sexual content presented can vary between romantic and assertive (Depending mostly of the player actions), the sex scenes may include stronger and sensitive themes such as Domination/Submission, BDSM, Sexual Assault, Group sex, Cheating, Sharing, Prostitution, Sexual Harassment, Harem, Power dynamics, Coercion, Multiple Penetration and spell/magic related tags like Transformation, Illusion, Cloning and Alteration\r\n\r\nThe player has the choice to romance one or more characters (over 30), the player can opt for poligamy, monogamy or nothing at all. Most of the sex content is heterosexual with the main player always being the male, there will be ocasions where lesbianism exists.\r\n\r\nDuring your travels through Ataegina you will encounter romance, violence, gore, alcohol, drugs, nudity and sex. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/78e4100f5f07d4e3519dfeb442038187.avif?t=1773177740\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a mage apprentice trying to figure out how the world works. Life hasn't been easy for you, since young age you learned the meaning of pain and suffering but what effect will that have on the older you? Revenge? Forgiveness? Once you move to the magic school your life will change and although you're not a big fan of studying, your natural talent and fate will help you reach the top of your college, and after that... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outside world awaits.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929140/extras/6b0c64b1d6c37956af45d2d99419e5a4.avif?t=1773177740\" width=598 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you age, and your power grows you will try to learn everything about the world you live in, spells and magic that serve your purposes, what kind of creatures, monsters and gods share the same air as you? What nations favor war over peace and what will that reflect on your own personality? Will you be at war with yourself or will you always be certain of what's the right path for you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you destined to be a savior or a destroyer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat